# `isolation.preview`

Resolve the isolation decision for an explicit tier/strategy without applying it.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.isolation.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `tier` | `string` |
| `strategy` | `string` |

## Returns

`IsolationPreviewResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `decision` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call isolation.preview --json '{ "tier": "", "strategy": "" }'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "decision": {
    "resolved": {
      "strategy": "docker",
      "tier": "container",
      "reason": {
        "os_default": {
          "os": "linux"
        }
      },
      "downgraded": false
    },
    "capabilities": {
      "os": "linux",
      "in_sandbox": false,
      "docker": true,
      "podman": false,
      "youki": null,
      "youki_rootfs": null,
      "lima": null,
      "tart": null,
      "wsl2": false,
      "srt": false,
      "sandbox_exec": false,
      "vz_framework": false,
      "firecracker": false,
      "apple_container": false,
      "fly_cli": false,
      "fly_authed": false
    },
    "user_profile_used": {
      "tier": "container"
    }
  }
}
```
